  "name": "DevX Connector: Rocket.Chat template (Preview)",
  "description": "## What it does\n\nDemonstrates **Template** mode with **Source: Rocket.Chat** using **Webhook → DevX Message Connector**. The connector converts Rocket.Chat text and attachments into sanitized HTML.\n\n## Setup\n\n1. Add a **DevX Message Connector** credential containing the full Teams channel link and configure `DEVX_CONNECTOR_API_URL` and `DEVX_CONNECTOR_API_KEY`.\n2. While editing, POST Rocket.Chat message JSON to `/webhook-test/devx/rocket-chat` and inspect the Preview response.\n3. Activate the workflow and configure Rocket.Chat to POST to `/webhook/devx/rocket-chat`. Change **Mode** to **Send** only after reviewing the output.\n\n## Notes\n\nPreview calls `<DEVX_CONNECTOR_API_URL>/api/v1/messages/preview` without posting to Teams; it is not an offline transformation mode. The Webhook passes `{{ $json.body }}` to the connector and responds after the last node finishes. No credentials or pinned execution data are included.",
